    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "45e83dc9d0251f62464f": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "52c3a824f85e97b2bfa2": "I am here for training.",
        "66e92b71c6efe2feaff8": "If you're here to be trained in the tactics and strategy of hunting, you've come to the right place!",
        "97cd1adc3791a935454c": "I kinnae help ye with trainin'. Ye should look fer a $c trainer."
      },
      "name": "Olmin Burningbeard",
      "subName": "Hunter Trainer",
